category: Database
requires: cygwin libcairo2 libgda5.0_4 libgee0.8_2 libglib2.0_0 libgranite6 libgtk3_0 libgtksourceview4.0 libintl8 libsecret1_0 libssh2_1
sdesc: "SQL Client built in Vala"
ldesc: "Sequeler is a native Linux SQL client built in Vala and Gtk. It allows you to
connect to your local and remote databases, write SQL in a handy text editor
with language recognition, and visualize SELECT results in a Gtk.Grid Widget."

